### Phase 1: Machine Learning Performance Overhaul (Priority)
- **Modify `offline_prediction_service.dart`:**
  - [MODIFY] Replace nested `List<List<List...>>` structures with flat `Float32List` buffers for image pre-processing.
  - [MODIFY] Implement sequential execution for ensemble models to prevent Out-Of-Memory (OOM) crashes on low-end devices.
  - [MODIFY] Add file size/checksum verification when copying `.tflite` assets to prevent corrupted models.

### Phase 2: UI De-coupling & Frame Rate Fixes
- **Refactor `analyze_page.dart`:**
  - [MODIFY] Extract `_OceanicBackground` and `_ProcessingOrb` into standalone widget files in a new `lib/src/features/assessment/widgets/` directory.
  - [MODIFY] Wrap heavy animations strictly in `RepaintBoundary` and isolate `AnimatedBuilder` scopes to prevent full-page rebuilds.
- **Refactor `result_page.dart` and `upload_page.dart`:**
  - [MODIFY] Extract heavy components (`_HeroPanel`, `_EvidencePanel`, `UploadDropZone`) into separate component files.
  - [MODIFY] Offload base64 image decoding (`base64Decode()`) to `compute()` isolates so it never blocks the main UI thread.

### Phase 3: Reliability & Error Handling
- **Enhance `prediction_repository.dart`:**
  - [MODIFY] Add a timeout circuit breaker for online predictions.
  - [MODIFY] Ensure image resizing happens strictly in isolates before passing byte buffers around.

